WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.440
BREATHE. Show a child breathing normally.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.635
INFLATE. Fill a cartoon balloon and bicycle tyre with air.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:11.202
WIND. Move a paper pinwheel with airflow arrows.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.882
OBSERVE. Compare still air and moving air.
